('127.413.d.2.G',3,'Test results that show too much drag lead the team to:','["stop", "hide results", "revise the design and test again", "change the data"]'::jsonb,2,'Iteration uses results.','original'),
('127.413.d.2.G',4,'The design process is iterative because earlier steps are often:','["forbidden", "unnecessary", "skipped", "revisited after learning from tests"]'::jsonb,3,'Learning requires revisiting steps.','original'),
('127.413.d.2.H',3,'Communicating an engineering solution effectively requires clear reports, drawings, and:','["presentations", "jokes", "rumors", "guesses"]'::jsonb,0,'Communication shares the design.','original'),
