('127.413.d.3.A',3,'A good way to prioritize tasks is to do first those that are:','["unrelated", "easy and boring", "urgent and important", "optional"]'::jsonb,2,'Priorities protect deadlines.','original'),
('127.413.d.3.A',4,'Setting deadlines earlier than the real due date gives the team a:','["smaller budget", "new goal", "longer vacation", "buffer for problems"]'::jsonb,3,'Buffers absorb delays.','original'),
