('127.413.d.3.C',3,'A milestone marks:','["lunch", "a mistake", "a major point of progress", "a rumor"]'::jsonb,2,'Milestones track progress.','original'),
('127.413.d.3.C',4,'Dividing a long project into smaller deliverables makes it easier to:','["avoid planning", "hide mistakes", "delay work", "track progress and catch problems early"]'::jsonb,3,'Small pieces are manageable.','original'),
('127.413.d.3.D',3,'A quick message to a teammate is an example of:','["informal communication", "a press release", "a legal contract", "a formal report"]'::jsonb,0,'Different types suit different needs.','original'),
