('127.413.d.3.E',3,'A common problem-solving strategy is to break a large problem into:','["rumors", "jokes", "smaller subproblems", "bigger problems"]'::jsonb,2,'Decomposition simplifies problems.','original'),
('127.413.d.3.E',4,'Problem solving in teams works best when members:','["stop talking", "hide ideas", "avoid testing", "share ideas and test them"]'::jsonb,3,'Collaboration improves solutions.','original'),
