('127.413.d.4.A',4,'A helpful critique of a wing design says what was observed and how it affects:','["appearance of the room", "performance", "feelings only", "lunch"]'::jsonb,1,'Link observations to impact.','original'),
('127.413.d.4.B',3,'Sensemaking in a team means understanding each member''s:','["address", "age", "strengths and perspectives", "hairstyle"]'::jsonb,2,'It helps assign work well.','original'),
