('127.413.d.5.A',4,'An executive summary generated from a template should be placed:','["on a separate planet", "at the beginning of the report", "in the middle", "at the very end"]'::jsonb,1,'Readers see key points first.','original'),
('127.413.d.5.B',3,'A drawing is the best format to show:','["a team vote", "a quote", "the shape of a wing", "a schedule"]'::jsonb,2,'Drawings show geometry.','original'),
